---
---
<section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-am-dark overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Grid background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5 bg-grid pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Glow orbs -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-am-accent/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-am-blue-mid/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Floating geometric shapes -->
  <div class="absolute top-20 right-20 w-24 h-24 border border-am-accent/20 rounded-xl rotate-12 animate-float pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-32 left-20 w-16 h-16 border border-am-yellow/20 rounded-lg -rotate-6 animate-float-rev pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 right-10 w-10 h-10 bg-am-accent/10 rounded-full animate-pulse-dot pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Process step indicators -->
  <div class="absolute left-8 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 hidden lg:flex flex-col gap-4">
    {['01','02','03','04','05','06'].map((n) => (
      <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-am-accent/30 flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="text-am-accent/60 text-xs font-mono">{n}</span>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-am-accent/10 border border-am-accent/30 rounded-full text-am-accent text-sm mb-8 reveal">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
      Metodología de diseño
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-8 reveal" data-delay="0.1">
      Diseñamos con
      <span class="block text-am-accent">método, criterio</span>
      y visión de producto
    </h1>

    <p class="text-gray-300 text-xl leading-relaxed mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal" data-delay="0.2">
      Nuestro proceso no es lineal ni rígido. Es un marco de trabajo flexible que adapta herramientas
      y metodologías a las necesidades reales de cada proyecto.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center reveal" data-delay="0.3">
      <a href="#etapas" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-am-accent text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 text-lg rounded-lg hover:bg-am-accent/90 transition-all duration-300 group">
        Ver etapas
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-y-1 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#metodologias" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 border border-am-accent/40 text-white rounded-lg hover:border-am-accent hover:bg-am-accent/10 transition-all duration-300">
        Metodologías
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Scroll indicator -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 reveal" data-delay="0.6">
      <div class="w-[1px] h-16 bg-gradient-to-b from-am-accent/60 to-transparent animate-pulse-glow"></div>
      <span class="text-gray-500 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">Explora</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
